  npin 1
  ppitch 1.26

  fuel U31 10.257 94.5 / 3.1

  mat ifba 3.85	 zr   0.81306 
                 b-10 0.09347 
                 b-11 0.09347

  cell 1 0.4096 0.4106 0.418 0.475 / U31 ifba he zirc4

  lattice LAT
    1

